<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23333" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infūsĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		infundo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a pouring in</i> or <i>into</i>, <i>a watering</i>, <i>wetting</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infusione emollit oleum,</span>”
				<i>a clyster</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					20, 21, 84, § 228</span></i>
			; v. infundo; <i><span class="en">id. 27, 13, 113, § 140</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caelestis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>rain</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 3, 25 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">theriacae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">veneni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. Apol. Dav. 3, 11 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">velleris,</span>”
				<i>a coloring</i>, <i>dyeing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umoris,</span>”
				<i>a flowing</i>, <i>flow</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 3, 8, 99</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">154</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
